From 8bc98956fa466a419c5f3bc634475a32b61fd540 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hanna Jose <hjose@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 16:03:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Description] : Adds firewall-side packet statistics support
 by introducing TRAFFIC_ACCT chain/rule programming, client stats file
 handling, and IPv4/IPv6 stats flow integration in source/firewall/firewall.c.

[RCA/Root Cause Analysis]: Packet stats DM state changes were not consistently reflected in firewall runtime accounting paths,
leading to missing or stale per-client packet counters across restart/disable/reset scenarios.

[Fix Description]: Implements enable/reset checks and helper routines to add/remove/zero packet-stats chains and rules,
sync client entries from stats files, and align firewall runtime behavior with packet-stats configuration.

Signed-off-by: Hanna Jose <hjose@qti.qualcomm.com>
